Allow a bounded five minutes for the upstream UI smoke test.

A cold GitHub ARM64 runner using Mesa software rendering exceeded the
original 120-second limit; a diagnostic rerun completed all checkpoints.
Retains the test script, assertions and failure propagation.

--- a/tests/ui_smoke.cmake
+++ b/tests/ui_smoke.cmake
@@ -9,7 +9,8 @@
   RESULT_VARIABLE result
   ERROR_VARIABLE err
   OUTPUT_VARIABLE out
-  TIMEOUT 120)
+  # Cold software-rendered CI runs can exceed 120 s; keep all assertions and a bounded timeout.
+  TIMEOUT 300)
 if(err MATCHES "cannot open the game window|renderer could not start|SDL_Init failed")
   message(STATUS "no display or OpenGL here: skipped")
   return()
